For any design, visual polish, mockup, illustration, or animation/motion task in this repo, read `.agents/skills/stageshow/SKILL.md` before writing code and follow its workflow (plan, closest gold example, craft and motion references, rehearse at the shown width and 390px).

- Every motion has a cause; the payoff holds; loops reset with a visible cause.
- Always ship a `prefers-reduced-motion` fallback.
- Verify layouts at desktop, ~1000px, ~800px and 390px.
- Don't import from `.agents/`; copy any kit parts you need into `src/`.
